+--!strict
+-- The Grashanveil crown (the Grashanveil set's helm): the crown of a Grashan
+-- priestess, a high ziggurat of pale ruin stone banded in sun gold, stepped
+-- narrower as it rises, with a gold sun disc at its peak and a short terracotta
+-- veil down the back. The base sits just proud of the head and nothing goes
+-- wide at the ears, so the head reads tall from the high camera.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local c = {
+	stone = { 150, 144, 130 },
+	gold = { 156, 126, 64 },
